On 01/14/2015 08:46 AM, Sherin Bopp wrote:
> Does anyone have a solution to this problem? Do i maybe have to
> include the covariates differently with theta? Any advise would
> really help me out here

This is officially a bug. It only occurs if you are using
parameterization="theta" in a multiple group analysis with exogenous
covariates.

This is now fixed in dev 0.5-18.767

Yves.

